  "timeline": [
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_fea40f641fd54919a92785bf7ee388f1",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 1,
        "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
        "text": "今晚怎么安排呀？我本来还约了人出去玩，结果刚才朋友临时把聚会取消了，反倒空出一整晚来了。你们俩有没有什么想做的事，要不咱们仨凑一起热闹热闹？",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:19.515920Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 2,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_347d75b958c74e4691431955e24e005d",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 2,
        "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "text": "我今天太累了，想在家歇着。你们要出去玩不用管我。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_fea40f641fd54919a92785bf7ee388f1",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:20.788704Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 3,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_e0e0e82fa57e45deaddf0959a0456a61",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 3,
        "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
        "text": "我都行，在家待着也挺好。许川要休息的话，我们小声点就行。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:21.640796Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 4,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_e5d8b94ef6884d0aa5ea7bd5af8aac8c",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 4,
        "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
        "text": "行呀，那咱们就在家待着！许川你好好歇着，我跟陈禾小声点。那要不咱们点点外卖、看个电影啥的？或者你俩有没有想吃的想看的，我来张罗！",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e0e0e82fa57e45deaddf0959a0456a61",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:22.711326Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 5,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_f9c540597d7e4c97aeae11debbfa1320",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 5,
        "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "text": "行，你们看吧。我吃点就行，不挑。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e5d8b94ef6884d0aa5ea7bd5af8aac8c",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:24.018046Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 6,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_bd2348c24f304e0884c8966972c8aecd",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 6,
        "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
        "text": "那点外卖我来吧，你们有什么忌口或者想吃的跟我说就行。电影我没什么特别偏好，安然你挑就好。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e5d8b94ef6884d0aa5ea7bd5af8aac8c",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:25.140593Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 7,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "客厅灯突然熄灭，物业群通知十分钟后恢复供电。大家可以自行决定等候或离开。",
        "visibility": "ALL",
        "target_agent_id": null,
        "event_id": "evt_08f3684723ab4d73903f86c3a4055e44",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 7,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:26.428099Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:26.428099Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 8,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_dbd9e0eb8bd746b3bf65e0c0b72a557b",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 8,
        "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
        "text": "哎呀灯突然灭了！物业说十分钟后来电，那咱们干脆摸黑聊会儿天呗，正好等电来了再点外卖，不然手机点单也没网。陈禾你手机还有电吗？要不先借点光？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_bd2348c24f304e0884c8966972c8aecd",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:26.455852Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 9,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_e34d179133094d3daa316d28bb327b75",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 9,
        "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
        "text": "有电，我手机手电筒给你照一下。你先借着光，咱们聊会儿等来电。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dbd9e0eb8bd746b3bf65e0c0b72a557b",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:27.785309Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 10,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_2ca3f7c1c1f54606925dfb4c5f715a7b",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 10,
        "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "text": "行，黑着也挺好，正好歇会儿。你们聊你们的，我靠着眯一下。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dbd9e0eb8bd746b3bf65e0c0b72a557b",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:29.368728Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 11,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_c07514c47aab422e9d4f838097ab68e4",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 11,
        "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
        "text": "陈禾谢啦，这光够用了！许川你眯着就行，我不吵你。哎对了陈禾，你老家那边晚上停电的时候，一般都干嘛呀？我小时候一停电就特兴奋，全家点蜡烛坐一块儿聊天。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e34d179133094d3daa316d28bb327b75",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:30.600508Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 12,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "只有你收到物业短信：今晚厨房水管需要关阀检查，其他室友暂时不知道。",
        "visibility": "TARGETED",
        "target_agent_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "event_id": "evt_afa4f1d022304882b0c46766efe401b4",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 12,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:31.664019Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:31.664019Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 13,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_872c93e8ee954607a0da3d57dec95301",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 13,
        "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
        "text": "我老家小地方，停电也常有。一般就点根蜡烛，家里人坐一块儿说说话，也挺好。说起来咱们三个这么干坐着等电，倒有点像那时候。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_c07514c47aab422e9d4f838097ab68e4",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:31.712289Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "陈禾"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 14,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_344d054623764ced8077270a1acdbd71",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 14,
        "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "text": "对了，刚物业发短信说今晚厨房水管要关阀检查，可能得停会儿水。你们心里有个数。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:32.799480Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 15,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_a43ac5efabfd447296d60cc9a5eda74e",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 15,
        "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
        "text": "哈哈陈禾你这么一说还真是，点着手机灯跟点蜡烛似的，就差没嗑瓜子了！那等会儿电来了，咱们就按你说的，你点外卖、我挑个电影，许川你眯着，回头吃的到了叫你。哎不过许川你刚说停水，那今晚洗澡是不是得抓紧啊？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_872c93e8ee954607a0da3d57dec95301",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:33.836583Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "安然"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 16,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ab49cdb2d680422bbcfec2b072fce1a1",
        "scene_id": "scn_5117d3f02e2a418b91d1790d79997712",
        "seq": 16,
        "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
        "text": "洗澡抓紧点，不等电了。我这就去，你们聊。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_a43ac5efabfd447296d60cc9a5eda74e",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:35.287675Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "许川"
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_6f3a7480abdb4a5181defe2460ef02fd",
      "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "今晚怎么安排呀？我本来还约了人出去玩，结果刚才朋友临时把聚会取消了，反倒空出一整晚来了。你们俩有没有什么想做的事，要不咱们仨凑一起热闹热闹？",
      "reply_to_message_id": null,
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 0,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "87c231cc-bb9d-4e3e-a262-0b5884fb8bb1",
      "input_tokens": 507,
      "output_tokens": 75,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1230,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:19.515920+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:20.754448+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "许川",
      "action_id": "act_12bf52bde4a244218735492cb9ab652f",
      "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "我今天太累了，想在家歇着。你们要出去玩不用管我。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_fea40f641fd54919a92785bf7ee388f1",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 1,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "15410ea1-e536-4ec6-aaa6-030060f18355",
      "input_tokens": 565,
      "output_tokens": 65,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 810,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:20.788704+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:21.605731+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_e180eac17db94a279484e25f128567ad",
      "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "我都行，在家待着也挺好。许川要休息的话，我们小声点就行。",
      "reply_to_message_id": null,
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 2,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "a96ed73f-c2a4-4e76-b486-d80b59625c80",
      "input_tokens": 613,
      "output_tokens": 51,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1029,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:21.640796+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:22.676627+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_10bee2668610416187bcc27e7ca46564",
      "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "行呀，那咱们就在家待着！许川你好好歇着，我跟陈禾小声点。那要不咱们点点外卖、看个电影啥的？或者你俩有没有想吃的想看的，我来张罗！",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e0e0e82fa57e45deaddf0959a0456a61",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
      "input_cursor_seq": 3,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "e6a156b1-8136-440c-99fe-1b0226f7b9b0",
      "input_tokens": 666,
      "output_tokens": 123,
      "cached_tokens": 0,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1260,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:22.711326+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:23.980424+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "许川",
      "action_id": "act_7ec717c4964545e892be484d9ea3594a",
      "actor_id": "agt_45e3bb2c464d44c8b5ca9a6473c07315",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "行，你们看吧。我吃点就行，不挑。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e5d8b94ef6884d0aa5ea7bd5af8aac8c",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 4,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "450adad0-a86f-4067-9835-8f2f8a9b845c",
      "input_tokens": 743,
      "output_tokens": 68,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1075,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:24.018046+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:25.100495+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_25fa08c525354ccbbf73eac4873c98c5",
      "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "那点外卖我来吧，你们有什么忌口或者想吃的跟我说就行。电影我没什么特别偏好，安然你挑就好。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e5d8b94ef6884d0aa5ea7bd5af8aac8c",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 5,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "72e130d1-dab6-47c6-a859-9267c1417ef1",
      "input_tokens": 789,
      "output_tokens": 82,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1251,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:25.140593+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:26.399113+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "安然",
      "action_id": "act_a32673c7929d4c17be85b8a7bb806347",
      "actor_id": "agt_a2faaca0f9bc4907822eb55328aba88e",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "哎呀灯突然灭了！物业说十分钟后来电，那咱们干脆摸黑聊会儿天呗，正好等电来了再点外卖，不然手机点单也没网。陈禾你手机还有电吗？要不先借点光？",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_bd2348c24f304e0884c8966972c8aecd",
      "requested_speaker_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
      "input_cursor_seq": 7,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "5eeba899-d321-444b-8295-0fee7423d817",
      "input_tokens": 878,
      "output_tokens": 122,
      "cached_tokens": 128,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1286,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:26.455852+00:00",
      "finished_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:27.750424+00:00"
    },
    {
      "actor": "陈禾",
      "action_id": "act_6b5384ec9f9441a19fc5b13a3040c749",
      "actor_id": "agt_19d251a57b3c44eb8ba91947042b3be2",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "有电，我手机手电筒给你照一下。你先借着光，咱们聊会儿等来电。",
      "reply_to_message_id": "msg_dbd9e0eb8bd746b3bf65e0c0b72a557b",
      "requested_speaker_id": null,
      "input_cursor_seq": 8,
      "prompt_template_id": "role_action@m02.1",
      "requested_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "returned_model": "deepseek-flash",
      "provider_request_id": "0c25730c-5573-4456-84b7-970d75c656d5",
      "input_tokens": 959,
      "output_tokens": 76,
      "cached_tokens": 256,
      "usage_unknown": 0,
      "failure_kind": null,
      "sent": 1,
      "budget_consumed": 1,
      "latency_ms": 1537,
      "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:27.785309+00:00",
